\noindent\textbf{Distinctive Features of SEED.} Compared to GAN-based datasets like SeqDeepFake~\cite{shao2022detecting(SeqFakeFormer)}, SEED employs advanced diffusion models (LEdits, SDXL, UltraEdit) for more realistic edits, diverse attributes, and finer annotations. 
