\paragraph{Q2: respecting coverage}
Selection functions should respect the coverage constraint of our problem formulation \Cref{eq:l2rank_abst}.
\cref{fig:COVres} (and \cref{fig:COVres_cat,fig:COVres_lgbm} in \cref{Appendix:additionalresults}) reports the actual (empirical) coverage $Cov$ obtained at target coverage $c$. 
