In all cases, $Cov$ is very close to the target coverage $c$. For \texttt{MQ2007} and \texttt{Web-30k}, the approach based on both the \BT{} and the \TM{} show an actual coverage distance from $c$ less than $\approx.001$.
The average distance is slightly larger for \texttt{OHSUMED}, with the largest difference of $\approx .002$ at $c=.75$ and $c=.70$.
