Also on \texttt{OHSUMED}, the $SelRate$ remains almost flat
% for both the Bradley-Terry and the Thurstone-Mosteller models
: the former's $SelRate$ is $\approx .163\pm.033$ for class $-1$, $\approx.249\pm.002$ for class $1$, and $.586\pm.082$ for class $0$.

