		Let $\ell \in \mathbb{Z}^+$ with $2\leq \ell < \frac{n-3}{2}$. If the q-ary NMDS linear code $\mathcal{C}=[n, n-2 \ell-2, 2 \ell+2]$ has an $\ell$-error-correcting pair $(\mathcal{A}, \mathcal{B})$ with $\mathcal{A}=[n, \ell+4, n-\ell-3]_{q^m}$, then $n$ is even and  
