\subsection{Certificates of globally strictly positive polynomials}

This benchmark is used to test our implementation of the extended Lasserre's method discussed in Section~\ref{sec:lasserre}. It uses two strictly positive polynomials by adding a positive constant to the Motkzin and Robinson polynomials. These polynomials are, respectively, of the form $x^6 + y^4z^2 + y^2z^4 - 3x^2y^2z^2 + 1/d$ and $x^4y^2 + y^4z^2 + x^2z^4 - 3x^2y^2z^2 + 1/d$ where $d$ is a positive constant.

