\textbf{Proof of Theorem \ref{th:dISS}.}
The proof of Theorem~\ref{th:dISS} is divided in different steps, specified here for better clarity.
\begin{itemize}
\item[1.] Prove that if \eqref{eq:dISS_condition} holds and if, for each $j=1,2$, $\hat v_j(k)=\tilde{A}_K\hat x_j(k)+\tilde{B}(\bar{u}-K\bar{x})+\tilde{D}_cw_{c,j}(k)\in\mathcal{V}(H_c)$, then
\begin{multline}\label{eq:dissipation_form_function}
    V(\hat x_1(k+1),\hat x_2(k+1))-V(\hat x_1(k),\hat x_2(k))\\\leq-\norm{\Delta \hat x(k)}^2_{Q_{c,x}}+\norm{\Delta w_c(k)}^2_{Q_{c,w_c}},
