\subsubsection{Traffic Model}
We assume the network supports traffic flows whose arrival and departure rate is not too fast. In other words, self-interference in static networks changes when a flow arrives or departs but, by assumption, the duration between changes is larger than the duration of channel occupancy prediction and channel hopping sequence update. 

