\subsection{Ablation Study}
To analyze the effectiveness of each component in the ML-DAGL algorithm framework, we conduct several ablation experiments under the swarm scale set to $N=200$. 

\subsubsection{Study of mDAG sequence}
\begin{figure}[!t]
