\section{Motivation} \label{motivation}
Although DNN models can provide state-of-the-art performance for many IoT applications, it comes at the cost of intensive complexity and prohibitive energy consumption. 
Therefore, it is critical to be able to efficiently execute DNN on resource-constrained edge devices. 
In this section, we discuss the experiments and observations that motivate us to develop an efficient DVFS enabled learning-based edge-cloud collaborative inference framework. 
