Since network bandwidth between edge devices and cloud servers dominates the offloading latency of feature maps, it is necessary to evaluate the robustness of DVFO with different network bandwidths. 
Due to energy and cost constraints, edge devices are equipped with \emph{WiFi} modules that have lower transmission rates compared with cloud servers. 
Here we limit the network bandwidth between 2Mbps and 8Mbps to simulate different network conditions. 
