Two widely used analytical frameworks for modeling DNN dataflow on custom accelerators are \emph{MAESTRO}~\cite{Kwon2020} and \emph{Timeloop}~\cite{Parashar2019timeloop}. Both tools systematically explore loop order, tiling factors, and data reuse patterns to estimate cycle count, energy consumption, and on‐chip buffer usage.

