Similar to previous studies \cite{hassan2012semi, hassan2010beyond, wang2014modeling, jiang2015understanding} that derive reliable conclusions from expert annotations, we also utilize these annotations as the query-level satisfaction ground truth. This large-scale and real-world dataset enables us to validate the application value of usefulness judgments from LLMs.
