	      \end{figure}

	\item
	      Drawing inspiration from the reduction mapping transverse field Ising (TFI) Hamiltonians to hard-core dimer Hamiltonians in~\cite{bravyi2017complexity}, we reduce stoquastic hypercube Hamiltonians to TFD Hamiltonians, via another second-order perturbative reduction (\Cref{lem:pathB}); see \Cref{fig:to-hypercube} for an illustration.

